DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The _p_a_m___e_c_h_o PAM module is for printing text messages to inform user
       about special things. Sequences starting with the _% character are
       interpreted in the following way:

       _%_H
           The name of the remote host (PAM_RHOST).

       _%_h
           The name of the local host.

       _%_s
           The service name (PAM_SERVICE).

       _%_t
           The name of the controlling terminal (PAM_TTY).

       _%_U
           The remote user name (PAM_RUSER).

       _%_u
           The local user name (PAM_USER).

       All other sequences beginning with _% expands to the characters
       following the _% character.

